  "$docs": {
    "status": "ACTZ is the franchisor tenant for an adventure-activity and lodging network: it owns the network's brand defaults and design tokens but ships no guest app, kiosk, or lobby of its own -- only the hq console. Member hotel and venue brands are separate tenants with organization.kind \"franchisee\", network.relationship \"member\", and inheritance.mode \"network\" pointing sourceTenantSlug at \"actz\"; they ship [\"hq\", \"lobby\"] and inherit these tokens unless they override them.",
    "contentModel": "ACTZ installs no commerce-catalog, operations, training, or device-wall capability itself -- it sells nothing, staffs no site, and declares no locations. Catalog, ordering, payments, and operations belong to each member property's own tenant pack."
  },
